Overview of changes in version 0.2.00
  - Option to pass a text for new entries
  - Options to select files (in/exclude them)
  - Using threads
  - configure got options --enable-debug, --enable-check, --enable-threads
  - Extracting Title, Comment, Author and print with date of last change
  - Unicode strings are converted to normal strings
  - Reading format options from INI-file
  - Reading comment styles as created by PhotoShop (another JPEG format?!)


Overview of changes in version 0.1.00
  - Handling JPG, HTML & M$ office documents
